@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@merchantA = demo-merchant-a
@merchantB = demo-merchant-b

### 准备：应用启动建表后执行 scripts/merchant-demo.sql；版本按查询结果填写。
### 商家 A 只读自己的两条商品
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/list
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"options":{"limit":100}}

### 商家 B 只读自己的商品 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/list
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"options":{"limit":100}}

### 整批成功；两条商品版本各加一，data.rows 为 2，data.items 按顺序返回各项目标与影响行数
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/updateBatch
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload":{"items":[{"id":101,"price":11.5,"version":0},{"id":102,"price":22.0,"version":0}]}}

### 第二项跨商家；409，商品 101 的价格和版本也回滚
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/updateBatch
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload":{"items":[{"id":101,"price":99,"version":1},{"id":201,"price":99,"version":0}]}}

### 第二项使用旧版本；409，整批回滚
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/updateBatch
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload":{"items":[{"id":101,"price":99,"version":1},{"id":102,"price":99,"version":0}]}}

### 确认两条商品仍为 11.50 / 22.00、版本均为 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/list
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"options":{"limit":100}}

### 匿名浏览：仅返回启用商品的 id/merchantId/name/price，隐藏 active/version
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/list

### 无效凭证：403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/list
Authorization: Bearer invalid

### 无商家身份的通用写入：403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/update
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload":{"id":101,"price":1,"version":1,"merchantId":2001}}

### 商家创建商品：归属自动填充，版本初始化为 0，无需 Controller / Handler
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/create
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload":{"name":"新上架商品","price":18.5,"active":true}}

### 商家按启用状态筛选、按 ID 排序分页；筛选与本人范围取交集
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/page
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"options":{"page":1,"limit":10,"filter":{"active":true},"sorts":[{"field":"id","direction":"ASC"}]}}

### 金额校验失败：400；规则来自实体 Bean Validation 注解
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/create
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload":{"name":"非法价格","price":0,"active":true}}
